#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:5
#: c9fcddd058a844b084958e5b04a419db
msgid "Vibration Damping"
msgstr "减震"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:7
#: 37b8ca997d2b447188705a716b3a7414
msgid ""
"Autopilots have accelerometers that are sensitive to vibrations. These "
"accelerometer values are combined with barometer and GPS data to estimate "
"the vehicle's position. With excessive vibrations, the estimate can be "
"thrown off and lead to very bad performance in modes that rely on accurate "
"positioning (e.g. on Copter: AltHold, Loiter, RTL, Guided, Position and Auto"
" flight modes)."
msgstr ""
"飞控具有对震动敏感的加速度计。这些加速度计的值与气压计和 GPS "
"数据结合，用于估算飞行器位置。若震动过大，估算会出现偏差，导致在依赖精确定位的模式下性能很差（例如 "
"Copter：AltHold、Loiter、RTL、Guided、Position 和 Auto 飞行模式）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:14
#: ddbd963996b04cf3814eeac6b7f6148a
msgid ""
"Please refer to the :ref:`Measuring Vibration <common-measuring-vibration>` "
"page for details of how to measure your vehicle's vibration levels and "
"confirm they are within the acceptable range"
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`测量震动 <common-measuring-vibration>` 页面，了解如何测量飞行器的震动级别并确认其在可接受范围内"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:17
#: 6836ba9212b7429aaafb3f7b6f0f587b
msgid ""
"The goal of vibration damping is to reduce high and medium frequency "
"vibrations while still allowing low frequency actual board movement to take "
"place in concert with the airframe."
msgstr "减震的目标是减少高频和中频震动，同时仍允许低频实际板卡运动与机架协调发生。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:21
#: 1098587474f7429f9bb49edd061a598a
msgid ""
"Double sided foam tape or Velcro has traditionally been used to attach the "
"autopilot to the frame. In many cases foam tape or Velcro does not provide "
"adequate vibration isolation because the mass of the autopilot is so small."
msgstr "传统上使用双面泡棉胶带或魔术贴将飞控固定到机架上。在许多情况下，泡棉胶带或魔术贴无法提供足够的减震隔离，因为飞控的质量太小。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vibration-damping.rst:28
#: c8a99462928c48e0b1304b9946b665e7
msgid ""
"The examples and images in this article refer to Copter, but the information"
" is also largely applicable to Plane and Rover."
msgstr "本文中的示例和图片指的是 Copter，但这些信息在很大程度上也适用于 Plane 和 Rover。"

