msgid ""
"Secure the autopilot to the frame with 1cm) wide velcro retaining strap or a"
" rubber band. Be careful the strap does not hold down the controller so "
"securely that it interferes with the damping of the pads. Consider putting a"
" layer of soft foam between the strap and the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"用 1cm 宽的魔术贴固定带或橡皮筋将飞控固定到机架上。注意固定带不要夹持飞控太紧，以免影响垫片的减震效果。可考虑在固定带和飞控之间放一层软泡棉。"

